    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d218">

                <pb facs="0300" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg224"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.00/1815</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Russell
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-05-06T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 6, 1916, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your May 3, noon; May 5, noon; May 5, 7 p.m. Two destroyers ordered each to
                    Puerto Plata, Macorís and Sanchez. <hi rendition="#italic">Panther</hi> and one
                    destroyer ordered Port au Prince to report to Admiral Caperton.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
